---

**Run**

```bash
ansible-galaxy collection install freeipa.ansible_freeipa

ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini ipa.yml --tags bootstrap --ask-vault-pass
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini ipa.yml --ask-vault-pass
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini ipa.yml --tags hbac --ask-vault-pass
```

**Check after bootstrap**

```bash
ipa user-show svc-ansible --all | grep -i expiration   # expect 20380119031407Z
ipa group-show admins                                   # expect admin and svc-ansible
```

Two things not to change without thinking: `action: member` on the admins task (without it the module manages the whole member list and can remove `admin`), and the order of the `ipauser` and `--setattr` tasks (the password set re-triggers forced expiry each bootstrap; the setattr clears it).